   000353         003818* C01 - C12 are special environment names supported by COBOL      00381900                                   
   000354         003819*                                                                 00382000                                   
   000355         003820* C01 through C12   : Skip to channel 1 through channel 12        00382100                                   
   000356         003821*                     Respectively                                00382200                                   
   000357         003822*                                                                 00382300                                   
   000358         003823* C01 is equivalent of ADVANCING PAGE. We will just support this  00382400                                   
   000359         003824*                                                                 00382500                                   
